(6597962, 983668, 10785, '<td valign="top">This shot is great for composition and emotion. I like the selective Desat too. I see something wierd going on with the DoF and I have seen this issue on a few photos. I would like to find out what it is so I can offer better help. The background blur looks all digital and jagged. Not a real creamy bokeh. I don''t know the cause, sorry. Maybe it has something to do with sharpening and noise reduction. I don''t know.</td>', 'This shot is great for composition and emotion. I like the selective Desat too. I see something wierd going on with the DoF and I have seen this issue on a few photos. I would like to find out what it is so I can offer better help. The background blur looks all digital and jagged. Not a real creamy bokeh. I don''t know the cause, sorry. Maybe it has something to do with sharpening and noise reduction. I don''t know.', '2011-11-18 13:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
