(6598526, 984456, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice enough if not stunning or profoundly moving. Cemetery shots by themselves are easy tributes. The shallow DOF combined with the repeating grave marker suggests a sad rhythm, an all too familiar echo. We see one name but know there were many others before (or after) him. The golden hues and wildflowers are also a meaningful touch.</td>', 'Nice enough if not stunning or profoundly moving. Cemetery shots by themselves are easy tributes. The shallow DOF combined with the repeating grave marker suggests a sad rhythm, an all too familiar echo. We see one name but know there were many others before (or after) him. The golden hues and wildflowers are also a meaningful touch.', '2011-11-19 11:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
