(6598696, 984518, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think the blood on the flag is a little clear and doesn''t show as blood per se. I think the white balance is off as the white stripes are showing up orange. There isn''t much detail in the medals. Perhaps a more over head viewpoint would help.</td>', 'I think the blood on the flag is a little clear and doesn''t show as blood per se. I think the white balance is off as the white stripes are showing up orange. There isn''t much detail in the medals. Perhaps a more over head viewpoint would help.', '2011-11-19 22:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6598698, 984462, 10785, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is from Germany or not, but it made me think, how would the German people remember past wars? It is probably a very touchy subject at any time. But to honor the heroes of the nation, the ones who work everyday to save lives, is a good choice. I think getting in closer to the man and making more of a half body portrait would have worked to better frame the subject.</td>', 'I don''t know if this is from Germany or not, but it made me think, how would the German people remember past wars? It is probably a very touchy subject at any time. But to honor the heroes of the nation, the ones who work everyday to save lives, is a good choice. I think getting in closer to the man and making more of a half body portrait would have worked to better frame the subject.', '2011-11-19 22:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
