(6600548, 984357, 46918, '<td valign="top">You bring back memories...Some good..some bad. Every day I prayed for my salvation. The lighting is good..the subject is good and the color is good.</td>', 'You bring back memories...Some good..some bad. Every day I prayed for my salvation. The lighting is good..the subject is good and the color is good.', '2011-11-21 21:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
