(6600680, 984482, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is the first image that came up for voting for me. out of curiosity, I''ll come back after I finish voting and give my thoughts then, but to start with, I have a feeling I''ll like this far more than the majority of the other entries. It is perhaps not fair for me to say that, but I''m just venturing a guess.<br/>Nice processing, a slightly different take on things, and the light on the graves is spooky yet respectful and prominent. Very, very, good.<br/> <br/>I''ve completed voting now, and this is still my favorite and highest vote, though you have a couple others that are also very nice. Best of luck.</td>', 'This is the first image that came up for voting for me. out of curiosity, I''ll come back after I finish voting and give my thoughts then, but to start with, I have a feeling I''ll like this far more than the majority of the other entries. It is perhaps not fair for me to say that, but I''m just venturing a guess.Nice processing, a slightly different take on things, and the light on the graves is spooky yet respectful and prominent. Very, very, good. I''ve completed voting now, and this is still my favorite and highest vote, though you have a couple others that are also very nice. Best of luck.', '2011-11-22 02:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
