(6679310, 984357, 134859, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the photo.  Had I been voting in the challenge, it would have received a 10 from me.  Great shot!!!</td>', 'I LOVE the photo.  Had I been voting in the challenge, it would have received a 10 from me.  Great shot!!!', '2012-02-16 11:42:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6693782, 984357, 18367, '<td valign="top">I have brothers who served in the USMC and shed a tear when I saw this image. I shared this image with friends who served and they all agreed that it conveyed a very strong and emotional message.<br/> <br/>Very well done my friend.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'I have brothers who served in the USMC and shed a tear when I saw this image. I shared this image with friends who served and they all agreed that it conveyed a very strong and emotional message. Very well done my friend. Ray', '2012-02-27 19:19:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6696540, 984357, 137576, '<td valign="top">like you said in your post about this being a 7.2 image, it pulled on the heart strings and patriotism of you yanks to your armed forces, if dpc wasnt so usa central i doubt it would have scored as high, i personally gave it a 7, as i appreciated the sentiment as i said a dark dank hello hole in afghanistan but it didnt have the same affect as it would on an american</td>', 'like you said in your post about this being a 7.2 image, it pulled on the heart strings and patriotism of you yanks to your armed forces, if dpc wasnt so usa central i doubt it would have scored as high, i personally gave it a 7, as i appreciated the sentiment as i said a dark dank hello hole in afghanistan but it didnt have the same affect as it would on an american', '2012-03-01 10:19:09.000000', NULL, 0),
